---
title: Reconciling stalled payments
---
flowchart TB
    R[StalledPaymentReconciliationHandler<br/>BackgroundService, polls every minute]
    D(dbOrder)
    G[OrderPaymentProcessor<br/>same code as the place-order handler]
    P(Payment provider)
    stillStalled{Still PendingPayment<br/>and stalled?}
    saved{Saved?<br/>ConcurrencyToken unchanged}
    done[Settled: Completed / AwaitingPayment / PaymentFailed<br/>+ outbox row if accepted]
    skip[Skip: a client retry or another<br/>instance settled it first; rolled back]

    R -->|1. Find orders PendingPayment for longer<br/>than StalledPaymentTimeout, oldest first| D
    R -->|2. Per order, own unit of work: reload| stillStalled
    stillStalled -->|no| skip
    stillStalled -->|yes| G
    G -->|3. Charge again with the same<br/>provider Idempotency-Key = order id| P
    P -->|first charge went through: same result<br/>never arrived: charged now| G
    G -->|4. Record outcome + outbox row<br/>in one transaction| saved
    saved -->|yes| done
    saved -->|concurrency conflict| skip
